            "review_title": "Review at Suon Cay - Cong Hoa",
            "review_text": "Tram Huynh\nVietnam153 contributions\n0\nNice location, good foods but staffs seem stressful\nFeb 2018 • Family\nI have been here several times with my family. This place is always crowded in the evening at least every time I came or passed by. Foods here are good and they have new dishes everytime I came. Service is quick but it seems like the staffs here are quite stressful, they are nice but they hardly smile and they dont even try to be friendly to guests. I couldnt blame on them. 1 staff has to serve 2 or 3 groups of guests at the same time. They still try to be polite as I could see. Hope the staffs could be better in the future. This chain is one of ths food chains has good quality of foods and service.\nRead more\nWritten February 7, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
